#: coverage/reportwidget.ui:20
msgid ""
"GCOV code coverage statistics.\n"
"\n"
"Set the directory to generate the report for and start the scan. \n"
"\n"
"Once finished, you can select the directories in the coverage report to see their statistics. A more detailed report can be seen for each directory, showing all the covered files in it. Each file can also be shown in the editor, annotated with line by line coverage information."
msgstr ""

